// Title: VM power state across subscriptions
// Source: Resource Graph
// Tables: resources
// When to use: How many VMs are running vs deallocated, across every subscription, in seconds.
// Tune: Run in Resource Graph Explorer. Remove the summarize line to list each VM.

resources
| where type =~ 'microsoft.compute/virtualmachines'
| extend PowerState = tostring(properties.extended.instanceView.powerState.code)
| summarize VMs = count() by subscriptionId, PowerState
| order by subscriptionId asc, VMs desc
